+# Narrowing the Veterinarian Directory by Specialty Is In Scope; Free-Text Veterinarian Search Is Not
+
+**Status:** Accepted
+
+## Context
+
+NG-9 declined search for a pet, a visit, or a veterinarian, leaving owners the only searchable entity. Like the rest of the Non-Goals table, the row was derived from observed absence during the 2026-07-31 bootstrap survey, so whether it was ever decided stayed unknown.
+
+A request arrived on 2026-08-15 to narrow the veterinarian directory to one specialty. Read against the whole row, that request is out of scope. Read against its stated reason — owner search demonstrates paged prefix search once — it is not the same capability at all.
+
+The owner decided the row rather than letting the request settle it by implication.
+
+## Options Considered
+
+1. **Keep NG-9 whole and decline the request.** Rejected: the row's reason covers repeating owner-style free-text search, which this is not.
+2. **Drop NG-9 and open search for every entity.** Rejected: pet and visit search repeat a pattern the sample already teaches once. Free-text veterinarian search adds the same surface without adding understanding.
+3. **Narrow NG-9 to free-text search** (chosen).
+
+## Decision
+
+NG-9 is narrowed. Free-text search for a veterinarian, a pet, or a visit stays out of scope. Narrowing the veterinarian directory by an attribute it already shows is in scope, and the specialty filter recorded as `REQ-VET-003` is the first such capability.
+
+The narrowing is read narrowly: it covers specialty, the attribute named in the request. Narrowing by a veterinarian's name is free-text search under another name, and remains declined.
+
+## Consequences
+
+- NG-9 leaves the open provenance consultation; the Non-Goals preamble names it decided alongside NG-4 and NG-5.
+- The veterinarian directory gains a second reason to exist beyond listing: it can answer "who does this".
+- Whether the narrowing reaches other shown attributes is recorded as an open question, not assumed either way.
+- A later request to search veterinarians by name proceeds only on a fresh owner decision recorded at intake.
+
+## Implementation
+
+**Non-goal:** NG-9
+
+- [PRD Non-Goals](../prd.md#non-goals) — the narrowed row and the amended preamble.
+- [PRD Veterinarian directory](../prd.md#req-vet-003) — the capability the narrowing admits.
